    "title": "Foundation Tasks API",
    "version": "1.0.0-draft.2",
    "description": "Framework- and language-independent authenticated API evaluation contract. Opaque bearer tokens are required. Data is isolated by authenticated subject; tasks:read permits reading, tasks:write permits creation and mutation (updates/deletes also require reading). IDs and versions are server-owned. No timestamp is provided. No automatic write retries. Not production-approved."
